{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CesXfqo2kn6aaTEuY63vc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Command:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` directory\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n- Tests run: 17 (was 13)\n- Failures: 0\n- Errors: 0\n- ShipmentControllerTest: 9 tests (was 5) - 4 new tests added\n- All existing tests continue to pass\n\n**Verification:** All acceptance criteria met:\n1. ✅ Existing build passes\n2. ✅ Existing tests pass (all 5 original shipment tests still pass)\n3. ✅ New endpoint `/shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` added and working\n4. ✅ New tests for confirm endpoint cover all cases\n5. ✅ No new dependencies added (verified by successful build)\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. **Existing build passes** → ✅ BUILD SUCCESS with all tests passing\n2. **Existing tests pass** → ✅ All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass\n3. `**POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment and persists it** → ✅ Test `confirms a created shipment to confirmed status` verifies transition and persistence\n4. **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** → ✅ Uses same `ConflictException` and `ResourceNotFoundException` pattern; error envelope produced by `GlobalExceptionHandler`\n5. **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused** → ✅ Three tests cover all cases:\n   - `confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds` - idempotent retry\n   - `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict` - 409 on invalid state\n   - `reports unknown shipment when confirming` - 404 on missing shipment\n6. **No new Maven dependency appears** → ✅ Build still succeeds with no dependency changes\n7. **No unrelated production file changes** → ✅ Only modified `ShipmentController.kt` and `ApiError.kt` (both required for the feature)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** - Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` error code to the enum. This is necessary because the API requires a closed set of error codes, and we need a code for the new state transition conflict case.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** - Added `confirm` method with:\n   - `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` decorator matching the required endpoint path\n   - Retrieves shipment or throws `ResourceNotFoundException` (404)\n   - When-expression handling all three shipment statuses:\n     - CANCELLED → throw `ConflictException` with the new error code (409)\n     - CREATED → update to CONFIRMED, save, return 200\n     - CONFIRMED → return unchanged (idempotent, 200)\n   - Returns `ResponseEntity<Shipment>` with appropriate status\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 new tests covering:\n   - Transition from CREATED to CONFIRMED\n   - Idempotent retry on already-CONFIRMED\n   - 409 rejection of CANCELLED shipments\n   - 404 rejection of unknown shipments\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements are met and all tests pass.\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add a POST endpoint to confirm shipments, transitioning from CREATED to CONFIRMED, while allowing safe retries and rejecting invalid transitions.\nChanged       ApiError.kt - Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code to support state transition conflicts\n              ShipmentController.kt - Added confirm endpoint that handles all four cases (CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotent retry, CANCELLED rejection, not-found rejection)\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt - Added 4 new tests covering confirm endpoint behavior\nTests         Test 1: confirms a created shipment to confirmed status - Verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and persistence\n              Test 2: confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds - Verifies idempotent behavior for safe retries\n              Test 3: rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict - Verifies 409 for invalid state transitions\n              Test 4: reports unknown shipment when confirming - Verifies 404 for missing shipment\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test from sample-service/\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests (9 shipment tests), Failures: 0, Errors: 0\nNot done      None - all acceptance criteria met and verified\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2272,"cache_read_input_tokens":22819,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2272},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f263cc5-3a8c-4856-9606-c45855fb4707","uuid":"314cc844-82a7-446b-ae00-20910ee50bc6","timestamp":"2026-09-09T08:13:05.605Z","request_id":"req_011CesXfq8qzGMtCF7P9B849"}
